Changes for this standalone distribution:
  Removed engine context, configuration, registries, export batching, metrics,
  lifecycle reporting, serialization adapters, and process-wide output services.
  Rebased modules/imports onto a single independent crate.
  Added a callback-based tracing layer and fallible synchronous console writes.
  Carried record-level dropped-attribute counts into console formatting.
  Retained the scalar fast path, structured encoding, and bounded buffer logic.
  Retained focused source tests and added standalone integration coverage.

