Changes for local macro ownership:
  Retained only the named, targeted event forms used by slogr's public macros.
  Unified the identical level-specific argument normalization into one helper.
  Renamed/rebased helper macros and runtime type paths into slogr.
  Inlined metadata construction instead of invoking upstream metadata macros.
  Omitted inactive legacy log-backend hooks, span macros, and unused forms.
  Used safe const UTF-8 validation instead of unchecked conversion.
  Consumed temporary value sets through callbacks inside their construction
    scope to preserve borrowed-field lifetimes under Rust edition 2024.
  Kept tracing runtime types, field visitors, dispatch, and subscriber behavior.
